WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.860
- Last time that Kym
Whitley was here though

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.353
she shared this moment.

00:00:03.353 --> 00:00:04.472
- My girl, my girl.

00:00:04.472 --> 00:00:05.460
- I was like, she better be your girl.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.880
Let's see this video.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:07.740
(Laughing)

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.850
- It was at an awards show
called the Neighborhood Awards

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.840
and Steve Harvey was giving
it and I was on the stage

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.630
and I thought I was gonna
be funny and say something

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.420
to Shemar Moore, flirting,
because you know my mouth.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.880
So he comes up and he looks at
me and I was like, Oh my God.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:24.900
And I whispered in his ear

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.670
and he came up close and
I said, don't pick me up,

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:27.600
please don't pick me up.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.520
He was like, I'm not going pick you up.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.920
And he grabs my face
and he sticks his tongue

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.753
- What?!

00:00:32.753 --> 00:00:34.290
- Down my throat.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.244
- [Kelly] Ew!

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.366
(Audience groaning)

00:00:36.366 --> 00:00:38.550
[Kym] And I don't even
know if my body can - Yes!

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.351
Look at that right there.

00:00:40.351 --> 00:00:42.883
(Audience cheering)

00:00:42.883 --> 00:00:45.660
- [Kelly] I mean, is this
how you remember the moment?

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.030
Cause see how I see it is
she was trying to be all big

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:50.580
and bold and you were
like, Oh, okay, checkmate.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.440
- I was gonna say, I was
gonna say she just gave you

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.070
the Kym Whitley PG, her version.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:56.414
Okay, okay, she started all that.

00:00:56.414 --> 00:00:58.530
I was minding my own business.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:00.510
I was sitting down in the front row.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.280
I was just chilling, enjoying the show.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.680
They asked me to come and
hang out and enjoy the party.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.750
Steve Harvey was in the
house telling his jokes

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.820
I'm sitting there and she
comes up, she gets introduced

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.950
to do a category and
starts running her mouth.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.600
She goes, Oh, what's up Shemar?

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.240
What's up light skin?
What's up light skin?

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.950
And she's like, I don't
even like light skin

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:18.210
but that's Shemar Moore!

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:19.530
So she just kept running her mouth

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.750
And then in my brain, I
was like, You know what?

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.583
Just go for it.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:23.416
Just call her out.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.560
And so I just got up for
no reason, impromptu.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.000
I walked up on stage

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.550
And then she kind of trotted over to me

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:31.560
and in my brain I was like, Oh we're about

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:32.946
to give 'em a show right now.

00:01:32.946 --> 00:01:34.680
And she had no idea.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:35.927
And I just was on one.

00:01:35.927 --> 00:01:37.710
I think I had a little sip of something

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:38.760
before I went into the show.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.128
- Some liquid courage.

00:01:40.128 --> 00:01:40.961
- And so I was like, all
right, let's do this.

00:01:40.961 --> 00:01:42.330
And so she came over and
she was looking at me like

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.500
You ain't gonna do nothing.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.367
And I was like, Oh yeah?

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.130
And so I grabbed her whole
face and just did the thing.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:49.320
And then she buckled, she
buckled and I was like

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.165
Girl, don't make me drop you.

00:01:51.165 --> 00:01:51.998
Don't make me drop you, cause
that's gonna be all bad.

00:01:51.998 --> 00:01:55.230
(Audience laughing)

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.710
- I love though that
she's so on all the time.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:01:59.970
I love her, she's a regular guest here

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.120
and I love her so much, she's so quick

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.950
and I love that you
caught her off her game.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.600
She was just like, wait, wait, what?

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.520
- Yeah, yeah, no, it was,
I mean, it was a big risk

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.740
on my part because you
don't mess with comics.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:11.640
You don't mess with

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.473
- [Kelly] The timing or?

00:02:12.473 --> 00:02:14.505
- Yeah, the timing, you don't
mess with that so I didn't

00:02:14.505 --> 00:02:15.990
- Unless you're Shemar
Moore and you're coming up

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:16.823
to give a kiss.

00:02:16.823 --> 00:02:20.100
- But if you notice, I
didn't have anything to say.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.260
I didn't need to say anything,
I just need to be about it.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:23.460
Get it done.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:24.623
- [Kelly] Oh, that's a
man right there, okay!

00:02:24.623 --> 00:02:26.130
- I stuck and I got out.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.960
- Oh my God, it was amazing.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.580
I just loved even her telling this story.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.413
She was getting all red.

00:02:30.413 --> 00:02:31.246
She was funny.

00:02:31.246 --> 00:02:32.079
It was funny.

00:02:32.079 --> 00:02:33.960
I just love anytime you can
get a comic off their game.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.303
It's like, that's hard to do.

00:02:35.303 --> 00:02:37.980
- That's honestly, I've
been doing this 28 years

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:41.112
and that's honestly you, one
of the most memorable moments

00:02:41.112 --> 00:02:43.080
of Hollywood, just because -

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:43.913
- Fun.

00:02:43.913 --> 00:02:45.531
It was so impromptu, outta nowhere.

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:48.540
I mean nobody will ever forget that.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.957
- [Kelly] Oh My God,
especially her. (laughs)

00:02:50.957 --> 00:02:54.120
It is funny what they hold
onto, but Sonic is CGI.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:57.240
So you've done a little
CGI work I heard on

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.560
was it Criminal Minds?

00:02:58.560 --> 00:02:59.393
- Oh yeah, yeah.

00:02:59.393 --> 00:03:01.422
- [Kelly] So, wait, tell
everybody cause this is amazing.

00:03:01.422 --> 00:03:02.478
- [Shemar] Okay.

00:03:02.478 --> 00:03:05.520
- [Kelly] Are you allowed,
cause for continuity,

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.770
do they like you to, cause
I haven't been able to

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.932
change hair before or do certain things.

00:03:09.932 --> 00:03:12.120
Were you supposed to -
did you get in trouble?

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.766
- That right there is one I
would really like to forget

00:03:14.766 --> 00:03:17.511
and nobody will let me forget it.

00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:21.600
What happened is my character,
this is on Criminal Minds

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.390
and my character - is
the Hondo beard for SWAT

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.550
but on Criminal Minds I had kind of

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.620
a perfectly manicured goatee.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.690
And so I had come to work thinking

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:34.350
that the day before was the
last day of the episode.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.690
So I shaved down my goatee

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:39.184
to almost nothing and it didn't match.

00:03:39.184 --> 00:03:40.920
So I got to rehearsal and I said

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.290
Hey guys, I just gotta let
you know this doesn't match

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.330
what I was doing, what
I was rocking yesterday.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.390
And so then they ran with it
and they were like, Okay, well

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.580
you know what, we're
gonna deal with it in CGI

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.290
but we're gonna have to
put green dots on you

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.440
cause then we can put the
goatee back on in post.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.348
And I'm such a dumb-ass

00:03:56.348 --> 00:03:57.373
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:57.373 --> 00:04:00.138
because I had heard stories.

00:04:00.138 --> 00:04:02.700
One of the crew members had worked

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.740
on a Tom Hanks movie and they said

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.590
Yeah Tom Hanks had that beard,
but they had to do it for him

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:10.170
when he would cut it too much
which was a complete lie.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.640
So they said that they had to put

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.530
green tape on Tom Hanks' chin.

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:15.000
So I'm like, well, Tom Hanks is

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.681
an Oscar winner, like, he's Tom Hanks.

00:04:16.681 --> 00:04:20.153
So if Tom Hanks has to do
it, then I gotta do it.

00:04:20.153 --> 00:04:23.370
So they put the dots on
and then my character

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:25.530
is in a serious scene
and I'm doing the scene.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.990
And then they came back
to me in after each take

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.980
and they said, You know what?

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.120
We're gonna have to put a little bit more

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.590
just so it's easier for us in post.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:36.390
So by the end of the gag I had
this whole green tape goatee.

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:37.969
I could barely move my face.

00:04:37.969 --> 00:04:38.817
- [Kelly] You are such a team player.

00:04:38.817 --> 00:04:42.570
- But I was dead serious
with a green tape goatee

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:45.690
and it took about the fifth
take to where my leading lady

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:50.470
who, baby girl, Kirsten Vangsness
she just couldn't hold it.

